Many of the gismu have fine distinctions -- too fine, in my opinion. 
Consider the difference between jars and bottles and such -- there is no 
need to retain this difference in Lojban. We should boldly simplify the 
gismu set. 

I thus humbly suggest that we should replace all the gismu with {badna}.

mi'e cntr

ko badna

